          <h3> Superhero Academy training
          <p> Run a 'training' circuit with a cardboard shield obstacle course, a web-crawl under strings and a power-up water station. Every child earns a graduation badge.
          <h3> Cape and mask workshop
          <p> Give each child a plain cape and mask to decorate with stickers and fabric markers. They wear their creation through the party and take it home as the return gift.
          <h3> Save the city treasure hunt
          <p> Hide clue cards around the hall that spell out a secret code to 'save the city'. Teams of five kids solve them together, and the winning team opens the treasure box of stickers.
          <h3> Kryptonite dessert table
          <p> Serve green jelly cups, popcorn 'power pellets' and juice labelled 'hero fuel' next to the cake so the food becomes part of the theme.
          <h3> Birthday hero spotlight
          <p> Give the birthday boy a gold cape and a 'Hero of the Day' sash, and let his friends cheer as he receives a hand-made medal before the cake.
      <p> EventAI — Intelligent Event Planning & Budgeting
    <style> @media print {
          body {
            background-color: white !important;
            color: black !important;
          }
          nav, header > .print\\:hidden, .print\\:hidden {
            display: none !important;
          }
          .page-break-before {
            page-break-before: always;
          }
          .break-inside-avoid {
            break-inside: avoid;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
          }
          @page {
            margin: 1.5cm;
            size: A4 portrait;
          }
        }"
`;

